OL,3,GNEWSAYoung butcher takes on world      
OL,4,Acompetitions                           
OL,6,FA young butcher is preparing to        
OL,7,Frepresent her country at two           
OL,8,Finternational competitions and hopes to
OL,9,Finspire other young people to take up  
OL,10,Fthe profession.                        
OL,12,FTia Williams, who has her own butcher's
OL,13,Fshop in Shrewsbury, is due to fly to   
OL,14,FLas Vegas for World Butcher Wars in    
OL,15,FApril and will then head to another    
OL,16,Fevent in Australia in 2028.            
OL,18,FThe 21-year-old started when she was   
OL,19,Fjust 14 and said: "I really like the   
OL,20,Fconnection of... knowing where your    
OL,21,Ffood comes from."                      
