OL,3,GNEWSAYoung butcher takes on world      
OL,4,Acompetitions                           
OL,6,FShe said: "There's not a lot of young  
OL,7,Fpeople getting into it and it's        
OL,8,Fsomething that I really want to promote
OL,9,Fand try and bring on the next          
OL,10,Fgeneration."                           
